loom witness=width_check verdict=green exit=0
loom witness=reds_ledger_monotone rows=128 disagreements=0 verdict=ok
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the twenty-line body published once, taking the rung as a comptime type parameter
file caravan/abate.rye and thirty-seven sibling rungs -- each body replaced by a three-line delegating stub
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish carry and bodies repinned to the measured fall, the queue and the GREEN line rewritten from this lap's measurements
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling lowered 76,977 to 76,348
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now block refreshed to this lap, prior edge folded into the one-line list
recommend keep-going recant_published at thirty-seven rungs by twenty lines -- 612 by realized fall, one identical body in every rung, the same five symbols already public throughout, so it is the head that widens nothing and it closes the glyph-note family. renew_path (720) and ask_path (660) return more and each widens thirty-one declarations; choose_pass (630) is public in forty-three yet reaches three private neighbors, so it opens three. After recant_published, the four-way merge of the glyph-note bodies into one taking suffix and glyph as comptime parameters is a single readable round.
